  "id": "braised-balsamic-chicken",
  "name": "Braised Balsamic Chicken",
  "subtitle": "Tender chicken simmered with tomatoes, herbs, and balsamic vinegar",
  "description": "Chicken breasts are seasoned, browned, and gently braised with sliced onion, diced tomatoes, balsamic vinegar, and dried herbs.",
